{
  "uid": "rag",
  "title": "RAG API and SLOs",
  "tags": [
    "rag",
    "slo"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "llama.cpp",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/llamacpp"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "SLOs (definitions: observability/SLOs.md)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error budget remaining (30d)",
      "description": "1 - (30d error ratio / allowed error ratio). Availability target 99%, TTFT target 95% of chats with TTFT <= 60 s. Negative means the SLO is missed. Prometheus keeps 31d on a volume; until 30 days of data exist this covers what has been collected.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "slo:error_budget:remaining",
          "legendFormat": "{{slo}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SLI over 30d (good / valid)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - slo:sli_error:ratio_rate30d",
          "legendFormat": "{{slo}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Burn rate (1h and 6h windows)",
      "description": "Error ratio divided by the allowed error ratio. 1 = budget lasts exactly 30d. Page thresholds: 14.4 (1h) and 6 (6h).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1,
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 6
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 14.4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "slo:sli_error:ratio_rate1h{slo=\"rag-availability\"} / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "availability 1h"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "slo:sli_error:ratio_rate6h{slo=\"rag-availability\"} / 0.01",
          "legendFormat": "availability 6h"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "slo:sli_error:ratio_rate1h{slo=\"rag-ttft\"} / 0.05",
          "legendFormat": "ttft 1h"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "slo:sli_error:ratio_rate6h{slo=\"rag-ttft\"} / 0.05",
          "legendFormat": "ttft 6h"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Firing alerts",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traffic and errors",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "/chat request rate by status class",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(rag_http_requests_total{job=\"rag-api\",path=\"/chat\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(rag_chat_errors_total{job=\"rag-api\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "in-stream errors"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "/chat error ratio (5xx + in-stream errors, 5m)",
      "description": "The availability SLI error ratio. SSE responses return 200 before generation, so in-stream failures come from rag_chat_errors_total.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "slo:sli_error:ratio_rate5m{slo=\"rag-availability\"}",
          "legendFormat": "error ratio"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM tokens/s (from rag-api usage)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(rag_llm_tokens_total{job=\"rag-api\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latency",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TTFT and total latency p50 / p95 (15m)",
      "description": "From rag_stage_duration_seconds buckets (0.05 to 120 s). TTFT is measured from request start to the first streamed token, retrieval included. Quantiles are interpolated inside buckets, so 30 to 60 s values are coarse.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(rag_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"rag-api\",stage=\"ttft\"}[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "ttft p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(rag_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"rag-api\",stage=\"ttft\"}[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "ttft p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(rag_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"rag-api\",stage=\"total\"}[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "total p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(rag_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"rag-api\",stage=\"total\"}[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "total p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Stage latency breakdown (mean, 15m)",
      "description": "retrieval = embed + BM25 + dense + join + rerank. generation = llama.cpp streaming. ttft and total overlap the others.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (stage) (rate(rag_stage_duration_seconds_sum{job=\"rag-api\"}[15m])) / sum by (stage) (rate(rag_stage_duration_seconds_count{job=\"rag-api\"}[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traces and quality",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Recent rag.chat traces (Tempo, click a trace ID to open it)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"rag-api\" && name = \"rag.chat\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "RAG quality (offline eval run, not live)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 26
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Offline eval, not from Prometheus. Source: eval run 20261008T113955Z, `rag/eval/results/20261008T113955Z/summary.md` (raw rows in `raw.jsonl`). 9-document corpus.\n\n| Metric | Mean | n |\n|---|---|---|\n| recall_at_5 | 0.867 | 30 |\n| doc_recall_at_5 | 1.000 | 30 |\n| latency_s | 7.999 | 30 |\n| faithfulness | 0.592 | 12 |\n| answer_relevancy | 0.798 | 12 |\n\nLatency is low because 27 of 30 prompts hit llama.cpp's prompt cache from earlier runs; see observability/SLOs.md. Judge scores: local 7B Q4 judge on ids 1, 4, 7, 10, 11, 12, 13, 16, 19, 22, 25, 28 (judge-20261008T120952Z/); rough, see rag/eval/README.md for judge limitations."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Logs (Loki, all compose services via Alloy)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log lines/s by service (5m)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate({service=~\".+\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "rag-api logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 36
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service=\"rag-api\"} != \"/healthz\" != \"/metrics\""
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
